	(text "SIX STATUS LEDS, AND THE COPY OF THE CPU CARD'S LOADED FLAG" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 12.7 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "de4c29f7-1c80-5bc6-b532-1eb0769e68bf"))
	(text "Each LED from +5V through 1k, sunk by its line: PWR to ground; Q and ROM by the IO card (Q_LED_L, ROM_LED_L); PAUSE\nand RESET by PAUSE_N (U7E) and RESET_N (U7F), low while the bus line is; START FROM RAM by !Q of U9A, a copy of the CPU card's LOADED\nflag made from the same bus lines by the same gates: set by LOAD mode (LOAD_L, U8A), cleared by a boot reset\n(BOOT_L = NAND(RESET_H, DMAIN_H, PAUSE_N), U8B). The CPU card's power-on reset is a boot reset: the two agree." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 17.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "a855d3a5-f81d-554b-a37c-c0ded8e974c0"))
	(embedded_fonts no)
)
